    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or fatigue since the third day after the infusion</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bone, thigh, or groin pain; no muscle cramps</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No jaw pain, loose teeth, or mouth sores</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No eye pain or redness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; no cravings; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

